flowchart TB
  A[Post a hiring request] --> B[Wait for applications in messages]
  B --> C[Review applications]
  C --> D[Accept one person]
  D --> E[Wait for them to pay]
  E --> F{Paid?}
  F -->|Not yet; they withdrew payment| E
  F -->|Yes| G[Do your part of the work]
  G --> H[Send progress files if needed]
  H --> I[Submit work for their approval]
  I --> J{They satisfied?}
  J -->|Ask for changes| G
  J -->|Approve| K[Close the job]
